    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "Designing a Passivhaus School",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Mulberry Academy London Dock is the city's largest Passivhaus school, with six floors of high-quality learning spaces. As you walk through the building, you will have a chance to experience first-hand the fantastic properties that this design rigour brings: stable temperatures, excellent air quality and optimised acoustics. Your guides will explain the design challenges, and how these were overcome by a committed team."
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Landscape strategy",
            "paragraphs": [
                "How do you achieve a green haven on a busy urban site? BD | Landscape will share their strategy that maximised ecology and utilised environment-enriching plant species to create a series of calming educational courtyards."
            ]
        }
    ],
